                        "entry_id": "f031a176-0cd6-390f-b756-feb028874da0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a sturdy manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6f2c7ed-45c7-42cb-8525-183cc673bffd",
                                "sense_id": "3fdfd72d-62d6-3fde-9ae1-efcbcdf550cc",
                                "text": "This table is so sturdily built that I can stand on it without fear of it breaking."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c72cab89-f215-4c6d-855e-94ea4ae69822",
                                "sense_id": "3fdfd72d-62d6-3fde-9ae1-efcbcdf550cc",
                                "text": "Look at the little fellows, mere bundles of fluff, paddling along so busily and sturdily."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ad05f7c-8e3e-4036-8135-22bef67b6661",
                                "sense_id": "3fdfd72d-62d6-3fde-9ae1-efcbcdf550cc",
                                "text": "I love the idea of setting a mystery in the midst of a women's newspaper; and the lesbian community, with our controversies and our collectives for local color, is a juicy topic for satire. However, most of the time, Schulman is incapable of setting us up sturdily enough to make knocking us down into an interesting enterprise."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
